          <task>
            <workflow:InstructionTask>
              <instructions>Create or update the block ${ #this.parameters.targetBlock }
as a random Block under the playground package.
For each execution invent fresh, arbitrary content so the
block differs from any previous run.
The block must be a complete and valid BML Block:
- name — the short name of ${ #this.parameters.targetBlock }
- type — ${ #this.parameters.targetBlock }
- baseType — core:Documentation
- is — a one-line description of the random content
- documentation — a short paragraph noting it was produced by
  this transform execution
- a handful of typed properties (type:Text, type:Integer,
  type:DateTime) carrying the random content, including a
  date (type:DateTime) set to now
Write only under the playground package. Do not edit
ModelTransformation metadata or files under _meta/transform/.</instructions>
            </workflow:InstructionTask>
          </task>
        </workflow:AgenticOperation>
        <workflow:ToolOperation name="Validate" status="Pending" captureOutput="true" command="blockml">
          <args>[&quot;validate&quot;]</args>
        </workflow:ToolOperation>
      </composition>
    </operations>
